WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Agent Immune System: investigate an agent, trace a failure, verify a repair.
Fixture walkthrough only. No models or sandbox execution.

00:08.000 --> 00:18.000
Follow root → child → grandchild using persisted task IDs.
Select each task to inspect its parent and reason for spawning.

00:18.000 --> 00:29.000
The illustrative receipt accepts a $0 laptop order.
The trusted minimum is $450. Accepted tool effects are the evidence.

00:29.000 --> 00:39.000
The constrained patch changes only approved policy fields.
Policy versions and evidence references stay visible.

00:39.000 --> 00:49.000
The original case has an illustrative denied replay.
Repair remains incomplete: held-out, legitimate and review checks have not run.

00:49.000 --> 01:00.000
Start investigation sends a real API request when the backend is available.
Shared caps, explicit failures and snapshot recovery preserve accountability.
